	(text "DEV PORT, page 1 of 3: Dev USB-C -> USBLC6 -> USB2514B hub (strap defaults, bus powered). Own 3V3_DEV\ndomain from Dev VBUS (AP2112K), so the Dev port works with the target unpowered.\nDownstream: DN1 P4 USB-Serial/JTAG | DN2 disabled (the C5 USB pins are its SDIO bus) |\nDN3 FT2232H -> page 'Dev UARTs' | DN4 RP2040 -> page 'Dev m1421 Programmer'."
